--- !u!114 &2098671031
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2098671029}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4e51596caa14b0a4bb7e935560de9c51, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastSignal.Runtime::LastSignal.Interaction.NoteInteractable
  id: l3_engineer
  title: Engineer's shutdown procedure
  body: 'EMERGENCY SHUTDOWN - EXPERIMENTAL RIG


    1. Refit all three transmitter modules (RF amplifier, power coupler, antenna tuner).

    2. Tune to the EMERGENCY CHANNEL (see the basement emergency log).

    3. TRANSMIT. The shutdown command only goes out on the emergency channel.

    4. Pull the master shutdown lever.


    The rig fights back when it is shut down. Do not stay in the chamber afterwards.'
  onRead:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
